      "my_answer": "It suggests the presence of an intussusception with the apex located in the right upper quadrant and an empty right lower quadrant where the cecum has been pulled upward.",
      "rationale": "Dance sign refers to the emptiness felt in the right lower quadrant due to the cecum being invaginated into the ascending colon, supporting the diagnosis of ileocolic intussusception."
